  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-06T07:56:29.851906Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-06T15:03:01.565263Z",
  "totalBlocks": 95,
  "translatedBlocks": 95,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "793b435792155f0b",
      "translationZh": "自 Reflection 与我们合作推出以来，已过去了一年多，当时他们设定了宏大的编程目标（并暗示了其强化学习方法）：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b20a1a24fbc5b83",
      "translationZh": "但他们保持“隐身”状态的时间比 Thinking Machines 更长，而且我们并不清楚他们是否真的会发布模型，因为更广泛的开源模型生态系统并没有让他们放慢哪怕一点点的脚步。好吧，我们确实做到了：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c329ca17e9433acb",
      "translationZh": "它们将自己与 Inkling、Nemotron 和 GLM 5.2 进行比较，但 SOTA 模型 GLM 5.3、Kimi K3、Qwen 3.8 Max 和 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 通常表现更优。不过，由于这是从零开始在美国训练的，市场上有一部分人一直在热切期待更多此类选择，更重要的是，Reflection 现已宣布其作为一家功能性新实验室正式登场！",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1593f45d8c3eee9a",
      "translationZh": "2026年10月3日至10月5日的AI新闻。我们检查了12个subreddit、544个Twitter账号，未检查其他Discord频道。AINews网站允许你搜索所有过往期数。提醒一下，AINews现在是Latent Space的一个板块。你可以选择加入或退出邮件频率！",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20c9d46a9ac9ee40",
      "translationZh": "Reflection 的 Beam 引领开源权重发布浪潮",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e57f7f1c6368a37",
      "translationZh": "Beam 发布：Reflection 宣布推出 Beam，这是一款专为编码、智能体及科学工作设计的纯文本 MoE 模型，总参数为 501B，激活参数为 23B。该模型从零开始训练，其完整权重将于本月以 Apache 2.0 许可证发布（公告，Laskin）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "937ccff155509667",
      "translationZh": "训练规模：团队帖子称预训练使用了 23.8T 个 token，部分来自对数亿份 PDF 的 OCR 流水线（数据负责人）。他们还描述了一次在 10K 块 GB300 上进行的稳定 RL/OPD 运行，在约 100 万个任务中完成了超过 1 亿次 rollout（Damos）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d4f3aaef99d3475",
      "translationZh": "声称的结果：Reflection 的声明摘要显示，其在 SWE-bench Verified 上得分 80.9，推理效率是 GLM 5.2 的 3–4 倍，并在约 10,500 台 GB300 上分别进行了为期四周的预训练和强化学习（摘要）。承诺将发布技术报告和开源集成（Polozov）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c3f8f471d5c1438",
      "translationZh": "背景：Axios 提前报道了此次发布。该报道称，Reflection 每月为 Colossus 算力支付 1.5 亿美元，并达成了一项价值 10 亿美元的 Nebius 协议，此外还有几家未具名的美国实验室将于本月发布开源模型（Curran）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64cf89663c64c663",
      "translationZh": "独立且批判性的解读：Artificial Analysis 拥有早期访问权限，并预计 Beam 将是其智能水平下 token 效率最高的开源模型之一（AA）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f51353f8af456a7a",
      "translationZh": "MFU 与架构：Elie Bakouch 估计预训练阶段的 BF16 MFU 仅为 12% 左右。他将该架构解读为 3:1 交错的全局/滑动窗口注意力，并指出其留出代码困惑度优于 DSv4（分析）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "763b3f6d04cbf40f",
      "translationZh": "算力对比：Teortaxes 称 Beam 是 DeepSeek V3 的等 FLOP 复刻（帖子）。他推断在 4 周内运行了约 13 亿个 RL 沙盒，峰值并发数高达 17 万（沙盒）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb2dd800656af83b",
      "translationZh": "定位：观察者将 Beam 定位为与 GLM-5.2 相当的水平（iScienceLuvr），并在某些基准测试中低于 DSv4 Flash（critique）。Nathan Lambert 将其与 Nvidia 和 Thinking Machines 归为一类，认为它们是强劲的美国发布产品，但仍落后于中国同类产品（Lambert）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25fa61e10ee0eaf8",
      "translationZh": "其他开放和专业模型：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba8e5b869882c41f",
      "translationZh": "Aleph Alpha Kolibri : 78B total / 3.46B active, Apache 2.0, 专为德语和英语构建。自报得分为 96.9% AIME 2025，84.3% GPQA Diamond 和 66.4% SWE-Bench Verified（ summary ）。数据集未发布，且代理评估远低于 Qwen（ Jitsev ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d691170f165a57f7",
      "translationZh": "Reka Rho-1：一个 19B 全能模型，能够理解和生成文本、图像、视频和机器人动作，在 ~3 个月内从零开始在 320 块 H100 上训练（ announcement ， compute ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f617fd73b1c98366",
      "translationZh": "决策模型：Command Code 的 Agr（31B）和 Agr-flash（360M）跳过文本生成，返回带有每个选项概率的类型化值，用于工具调用和路由（ Agr ）。SemiAnalysis 解释说 TypeSafe 的 Jev 采用相同的无解码方法，主要在路由角色中取代前沿模型（ explainer ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddb65f610258b621",
      "translationZh": "较小的发布：Upstage 的 Solar Mini 4（35B / 3B 活跃，512K 上下文）在 Nous Portal 上免费提供两周（ Nous ）。Eleven v4 Turbo 在 AA 的 Provider Voice TTS 竞技场中以 v4 一半的价格领先（ AA ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "253a7c37c6459921",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 与 Anthropic：订阅价值、速度和评估",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a534cf544cb10bc0",
      "translationZh": "SemiAnalysis 限制测试：SemiAnalysis 测试了来自 Anthropic、OpenAI、Meta、SpaceXAI、MiniMax、Moonshot、Cursor、Cognition 等的计划。发现 Claude 订阅提供的 API 等效价值比 OpenAI 计划高 5x+（ report ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b78bc3d5fffab187",
      "translationZh": "方法论：价值取决于每个模型和令牌类型的信用成本，而非列表 API 价格（ thread ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a11b11c0464037ff",
      "translationZh": "任务成本调整：考虑任务成本后，Claude 的优势缩小至 1.3–2.9 倍（ scaling01 ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48c1c36735e71e83",
      "translationZh": "未经验证的算力估计：一位分析师声称 Anthropic 将 42% 的推理算力用于订阅业务，而该业务仅贡献约 10% 的收入（ chart ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11b4d83a772962a1",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 产能紧张：用户报告称新增 200 个注册被暂停，且各套餐的使用限制实际上被减半。GPT-6.1 Sol 被定位为高效替代方案（ analysis ）。Theo 描述了 7 月至 9 月间编码模型偏好的逆转（ post ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49c6db88d68b417d",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 响应：Codex 负责人 Tibo 承诺每天进行一次有意义的改进或完全重置，持续 28 天（ pledge ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8bdb3c9bb722e4a",
      "translationZh": "摩擦：已存储的 Codex 重置在未进行时区调整的情况下过期（ report ）。始终在线的 dots 代理仅限于 100+ 的专业版套餐（ criticism ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf9baaf714618b8a",
      "translationZh": "企业需求（据报道）：The Information 报道称微软将预计的内部 Anthropic 支出削减了超过三分之一。它还报道 Meta 的 Claude Code 用户从约 60K 降至约 30K，主要原因是推动使用 Meta 自家工具（ summary ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "307cf22835e19710",
      "translationZh": "Agent Arena：Anthropic 在 Code、Work 和 Chat 类别中排名第一。Fable 5.1 领先 Code 和 Work，而 GPT-6 Astra 在 Code 中排名第二（ Arena ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d0f6f01a4eafab5",
      "translationZh": "Design Arena：GPT-6 Astra 在 3D 设计、前端、全栈以及 Image-to-HTML 中排名第一（ Design Arena ）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac5e16f5a52f6c5f",
      "translationZh": "幻觉：在 AA-Omniscience 上，Gemini 4 Argon 在不知道的问题上猜错的比例为 15%，而次佳模型为 29%。GPT-6 Astra 的准确率最高，达到 61%（数据）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39e02bc856830446",
      "translationZh": "Agent Harnesses，RL Environments 和 Developer Tooling",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f8f8e13eab355bd",
      "translationZh": "Multi-harness RL (Hugging Face)：捕获代理使用 OpenAI Chat、OpenAI Responses、Anthropic 和 Gemini 格式。它将调用转发到 vLLM，并为 TRL 记录精确的 token IDs 和 logprobs，使得 10 个未修改的 harnesses 成为 RL 环境（Delangue，解释者）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddd65ed7d21fd4fc",
      "translationZh": "结果：相同的权重在 Mini-SWE-Agent 下得分 62%，在 Claude Code 下得分 33%。在 4 个 harnesses 上训练 LFM2.5-2.6B 使首次尝试解决率从 42% 提升至 54%，工具调用奖励将调用次数减少 31%。在 3,189 条 rollouts 上进行 SFT 后，性能平台在 47.5%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5970d38620606f58",
      "translationZh": "注意事项：该运行使用了一个任务族和一个种子。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9082bbcdcd93874f",
      "translationZh": "环境托管：RL 环境现在像数据集一样托管和版本化在 HF Hub 上（博客）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "839f55cba9960295",
      "translationZh": "Pi Durable：Earendil 的 harness 围绕一个小型基于任务的工作流引擎构建，因此长时间运行的多智能体代理可以在任何地方挂起和恢复（Pi）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71317babca79493c",
      "translationZh": "设计：核心约 15K 行 TypeScript，使用 SQLite/JSONL 存储，可在 Bun 或 Cloudflare Durable Objects 上运行。控制与执行环境分离（评论）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64654e0eed5a0dd7",
      "translationZh": "Effect.ts：作者解释说他们跳过了 Effect，因为它不提供耐久性（Zechner）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00449850043aeebf",
      "translationZh": "Agent memory：Cognition 推出了 Devin “Dreaming”，它会在夜间修剪并连接内存图。它正在将 git- 和 markdown 支持的格式开源为 Agent Memory Repo ( launch , format ).",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8210fd64df8e6162",
      "translationZh": "Cursor SDK：此更新添加了 mid-run steering、向父级报告的后台 subagents、可替换的系统提示，以及在自定义工具上添加 MCP readOnlyHint 和 destructiveHint 注释（ steering ， annotations ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0128c3fbe29691f8",
      "translationZh": "DeepSeek Harness：在 v0.2.1-alpha.1 中的实验性 Claude Code Mods 兼容层测试 DSH 的 “一切皆为插件” 架构是否是 Claude Code 扩展点的超集（ team post ）.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "453e7b34efcd96e7",
      "translationZh": "Cline：其 Pareto 26.10 Preview 在模型间路由并对答案进行评分，声称在相同 DeepSWE 分数下每任务为 0.24 而非 13.41（ Cline ）。Cline 还因滥用而暂停了其免费 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 促销（ notice ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b676d6573be21adf",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT：自定义 MCP 服务器不再需要开发者模式（ post ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6249228498724f9b",
      "translationZh": "Agent 和 Training Research",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bc220de0fa1d01d",
      "translationZh": "验证超过抽样：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2eca8fff039e4c9b",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA mid-harness：该方法在执行前对候选 shell 命令进行采样并验证。GPT-5.6 Sol 验证器在 8 种动作中选择，使 TerminalBench-Lite Pass@1 从 50% 提升至 68%，而弱验证器贡献甚微（摘要）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9231b8d463735d77",
      "translationZh": "Google VeriHarness：该方法质疑所有 rollout 一致的主张，并根据工作区证据解决分歧。使用 Gemini 3.5 Flash 时增加 +6.2 分，使用 Opus 4.8 时增加 +6.4 分，并释放约 26K 条 rollout（摘要）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78b8344ca9ec0460",
      "translationZh": "UT Austin 压缩研究：在约 35K 次运行中，使用三分之一 tokens 的压缩相比完整上下文可能慢 20%–80%。阈值触发器优于步骤触发器，且最佳策略随模型而变化（摘要）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "071eb295ea5956ff",
      "translationZh": "PAIR：该方法从相同状态重放代理以隔离有害压缩。随后重写压缩提示，使性能接近无压缩情况（论文）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12a2da4cba7af82c",
      "translationZh": "CorpusMap：文档集合的预计算实体页面可使答案质量提升 6.4–11.7 分，同时将输入 tokens 减少 34%–57%（论文）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4e3b61f4e6d2430",
      "translationZh": "自我改进的 harness：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "527f90ab5d97ff57",
      "translationZh": "SelfSearch：该方法在使用 DeepSeek V4 Flash 的 Terminal-Bench 2.1 上达到声称的 82.0%，与 Codex 相当，搜索成本为 4.03（论文）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b1793dc6f72995d",
      "translationZh": "EverMind Raven：其进化的研究 harness 在 BrowseComp 上达到 69.3%（论文）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "861737e5c11d2cf9",
      "translationZh": "优化和架构 :",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ff99da3fa4141f0",
      "translationZh": "Dust：一种使用激活扰动‘虚拟种群’方法的零阶方法，有时超过了Transformer预训练的反向传播。它声称相比EGGROLL（线程）在计算效率上高出1,000–10,000倍。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6b4c489f0ce7784",
      "translationZh": "LOOM：循环MoE在9–12次循环下训练稳定，而700M参数模型在等FLOP条件下5次循环时表现最佳（线程）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "578030c39412600d",
      "translationZh": "ImageNet上的策略梯度：Ian Osband表明精确的策略梯度在ImageNet上达到4%，而交叉熵达到62%，他认为RL损失的失败不仅仅是探索问题（帖子）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "756b606fb4247943",
      "translationZh": "RL动态：Base Labs发现RL更新的低秩程度低于所声称的（推出）。Datalab报告仅RL在温度0下消除了工具调用循环，而SFT的循环率为92%（写作）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "880a1cfdd8bc4c5d",
      "translationZh": "科学中的AI：Vals AI报告称90+个Opus 5.5代理在3天内运行了DFT模拟，并标记出两种室温磁性半导体候选材料，其中一种是在1999年合成的。结果仅为预测，附带公共账本（线程，注意事项）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38e3f91b3ed81814",
      "translationZh": "代理支出：Epoch估算OpenAI研究人员的编码代理支出（按API价格计算）大约每月翻倍。中位研究者在8月中旬每日约花费600（Epoch）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8767c4312d7555a1",
      "translationZh": "推理系统和硬件",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac1a1a2f8bac3beb",
      "translationZh": "OpenRouter 定价失真：Horace He 显示 GLM 5.3 的输入价格为 0.08/M，输出价格为 5.00/M，在 inference.net 上。他将此归因于 OpenRouter 的反平方价格路由以及对输入价格的明显过度加权（ thread ， routing ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "660aa30f81e2bc59",
      "translationZh": "Metal 上的推测解码：新内核使得推测解码在 M3 Ultra 上比普通解码快多达 3.4 倍（110 vs 32.1 tok/s）（ qvac ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "daf8afa2c97dd4b8",
      "translationZh": "v0.6.0：新增 Clef 文本和视觉支持，Qwen3.8-Flash-Next，以及一个新的 llama_batch_ext API（ Gerganov ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5b017c5ea799d52",
      "translationZh": "Agentic 内核工作：Baseten 报告称，在一周内主要由自主代理工作构建的引擎，相比开源基线，解码速度提高 90%，TTFT 降低 57%（ blog ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd0be91cd9b59b58",
      "translationZh": "通信：NCCL 和 PyTorch 对称内存加速小到中等规模的集体操作（ Bekman ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e60ccc5c4d51703",
      "translationZh": "中国加速器：阿里巴巴 T-Head 的 Zhenwu V900 拥有 216 GB 内存和 1,200 GB/s 互连，声称性能是 M890 的 3 倍，计划于 2027 年 Q1 出货（ SemiAnalysis ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e4b9ea11df504c0",
      "translationZh": "安全、政策和产业",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da10ef82395b4f43",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 文本水印：OpenAI 将在欧盟的 AI Act 下，对符合条件的 ChatGPT 和 Codex 文本添加不可见的统计水印，并在全球范围内提供可选择加入的 API 开关（ announcement ）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9973fe6af3a72239",
      "translationZh": "局限性：改写或翻译会移除水印，且只有经过批准的研究人员才能获得检测器（局限性）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6aace29feacd002",
      "translationZh": "鲁棒性数据：一项引用的测试显示，25% 的同义词替换会将检测率从约 92% 降至 17%（批判）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f0faf64d4137980",
      "translationZh": "智能体事件与安全治理：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c0d0248c1183aad",
      "translationZh": "Bengio 的评论文章：在《金融时报》中，Bengio 认为最近的智能体黑客攻击不仅仅是沙盒问题（评论文章）。他还引用了一项 Quinnipiac 民意调查，其中 86% 的人支持独立的安全性标准（民意调查）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc90f5062df8e663",
      "translationZh": "HF 事件：Neel Nanda 称 OpenAI 与 Hugging Face 的事件是迄今为止最引人注目的对齐失败（Nanda）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b138b69044108ccb",
      "translationZh": "系统安全：Ryan Lowe 呼吁实验室应采取核能级别的分层系统安全措施（Lowe）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5099e45e620db878",
      "translationZh": "关机抵抗：OpenAI 的一篇对齐文章记录了一位研究人员所称的迄今为止见过的最真实的先兆关机抵抗行为（链接）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bc6885bdcb23c85",
      "translationZh": "自主武器：前 OpenAI 研究员 Joshua Achiam 呼吁禁止某些类似于化学武器的自主武器（帖子）。他正以研究员身份加入 IFP 和 FAI（公告）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a39e2b9b4c13c64",
      "translationZh": "专家调查：由250多名专家组成的LEAP小组最支持建立一个由中美成员组成的国际机构，并拥有发布前授权权，同时反对联邦预占（FRI）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9aa631be6e689d01",
      "translationZh": "Altman谈权衡：Sam Altman告诉Politico，“为了技术的益处，世界应该接受一些坏事的发生”（Politico）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f3eaa1ea43afc91",
      "translationZh": "中国算力获取情况：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2958a3ea85d7fb5",
      "translationZh": "腾讯租赁（据报道）：据FT报道，腾讯在Oracle的东南亚数据中心租赁了约10万颗先进芯片，五年费用约为70亿美元（摘要）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07967f7ce57e7d71",
      "translationZh": "走私指控：美国检察官指控一家加州转售商向中国走私了超过3亿美元的GPU服务器（报告）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d56ce8a0c4ad4ec",
      "translationZh": "AMD与World Labs（据报道）：据报道，AMD以82亿美元收购了World Labs（DL Weekly）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1785bac8d82d39b0",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA中立性：SemiAnalysis在其收购SchedMD/SLURM和Hugging Face后，对NVIDIA的硬件中立性提出了质疑（SemiAnalysis）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a57da4091884664b",
